--- !u!114 &114293553378549153
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1420060389751918}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 198
  indentLevel: 1
  storyText: 枯木长老...似乎未曾听其他长老提起过，也不知道是何许人。至少听刚才的弟子所言，枯木长老和失踪有些关系，我那道友的朋友莫不也是被其抓去做苦力才误了约定？
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 0
  AvatarID: {fileID: 0}
  AvatarIntID: 1
